{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool aggregation with transformer aggregation in a multimodal multiprofile setup using scvi_n200 RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoders with concat fusion. Validation accuracy improved to 0.7207 (from 0.7150 in config_007), suggesting transformer aggregation may enhance performance. However, the relative contribution of aggregation strategy versus encoder interactions remains uncertain without further isolation of variables."
}

